            set of axioms for Lorentzian geometry was developed in these articles
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                Edwin B. Wilson &amp; Gilbert N. Lewis (1912)
                %em The Space-time Manifold of Relativity. The Non-Euclidean Geometry of Mechanics and Electromagnetics
                Proceedings of the American Academy of Arts and Sciences 48:387–507
            %li
              %p
                James Cockle,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Synthetic Spacetime
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://web.archive.org/web/20090926011519/http://ca.geocities.com/cocklebio/synsptm.html"} web
